<headroom-library version="1" id="clean-neo-soul-silk" category="Clean" order="120" instrument="guitar" style="Neo-Soul">
  <description>Warm, silky clean for extended voicings and hammer-on fills: a tube leveler, a small blackface combo with the bright switch off and mids kept, a slow, subtle analog chorus and a soft room. Neck or middle pickup with the tone rolled back a little; let the chords breathe.</description>
  <tags><tag>Clean</tag><tag>Neo-Soul</tag><tag>R&amp;B</tag><tag>Chorus</tag><tag>Compressed</tag><tag>Room</tag></tags>
  <sources>
    <source url="https://www.guitarchalk.com/neo-soul-guitar-amp-settings/" title="Guitar Chalk: neo-soul guitar amp settings"/>
    <source url="https://www.tonemirror.so/genres/neo-soul" title="ToneMirror: neo-soul guitar tone (settings survey)"/>
    <source url="https://www.fundamental-changes.com/book/neo-soul-guitar-book/" title="Fundamental Changes: The Neo-Soul Guitar Book"/>
    <source url="https://tonestakr.com/guides/how-to-get-neo-soul-guitar-tone/" title="Tonestakr: how to get neo-soul guitar tone"/>
  </sources>
</headroom-library>
</headroom-preset>
